				<li ><a href="https://www.bennett.edu.in/media-center/bu-in-news/">BU in News </a></li>
				<li ><a href="https://www.bennett.edu.in/media-center/news-room/">Newsroom</a></li>
				<li><a target="_blank" href="http://www.timesofbennett.com/">Times of Bennett</a></li>
				<li ><a href="https://www.bennett.edu.in/media-center/social-media-hub/">Social Hub</a></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>

	
</div>
 
